       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MKPORT.
      * Parity helper: creates an empty indexed PORTFILE (VSAM KSDS).
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PORTFOLIO-FILE ASSIGN TO PORTFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS PORT-KEY FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PORTFOLIO-FILE.
           COPY PORTFLIO.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FS PIC XX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT PORTFOLIO-FILE
           CLOSE PORTFOLIO-FILE
           GOBACK.
